# Code owners for databricks/environments.
#
# Security-sensitive paths (CI workflows, the scripts CI executes, and the
# generated dependency-constraint artifacts) require review from a maintainer.
# Pair this file with a branch-protection rule on `main` that enables
# "Require review from Code Owners" and requires >= 1 approving review —
# CODEOWNERS alone does not block merges without that setting.

# CI workflows and actions.
/.github/workflows/   @rugpanov @rclarey @anton-107
/.github/actions/     @rugpanov @rclarey @anton-107

# Scripts executed by CI.
/.github/scripts/     @rugpanov @rclarey @anton-107

# Ownership of CODEOWNERS itself.
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @rugpanov @rclarey @anton-107

# Generated dependency-constraint artifacts consumed by downstream tooling.
/python/              @rugpanov @rclarey @anton-107
